A subquery is a query inside another query.
It is used when two conditions are used in a same statement.


SELECT name
FROM Employee
WHERE salary > (
    SELECT AVG(salary)
    FROM Employee
);


SELECT e1.name
FROM Employee e1
WHERE salary >
(
    SELECT AVG(salary)
    FROM Employee e2
    WHERE e1.dept_id = e2.dept_id
);
